---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import { companyInfo } from '../data/company';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - Unity Compass"
  description="Read Unity Compass's Privacy Policy regarding information collection, data security, your rights, and practices on www.unitycompass.com."
>
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-brand-dark text-white py-14 sm:py-20 border-b border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase bg-brand-red/20 text-red-400 border border-brand-red/30 mb-3">
        Compliance & Legal
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-2">
        Last Updated: February 2026 • Unity Compass LLC
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Policy Body -->
  <article class="py-16 sm:py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-700 leading-relaxed space-y-8">
      
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="m-0">
          At Unity Compass, we are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you interact with our LinkedIn Ads and visit our website, <a href="https://unitycompass.com" class="text-brand-navy font-semibold underline">www.unitycompass.com</a>. By using our website or engaging with our ads, you consent to the practices described in this policy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
          1. Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p>We may collect the following types of information:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 pl-4 list-disc">
          <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> When you interact with our LinkedIn Ads or website, we may collect personal information such as your name, email address, phone number, job title, company name, and any other information you voluntarily provide.</li>
          <li><strong>Automated Data:</strong> We may collect information automatically through cookies, pixels, and other tracking technologies. This includes your IP address, browser type, device information, browsing behavior, and interactions with our ads or website.</li>
          <li><strong>LinkedIn Data:</strong> If you engage with our LinkedIn Ads, LinkedIn may provide us with aggregated and anonymized data about ad performance and audience demographics. This data does not personally identify you.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
          2. How We Use Your Information
        </h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 pl-4 list-disc">
          <li>To deliver and optimize our LinkedIn Ads and federal contracting content.</li>
          <li>To respond to your inquiries and provide customer and proposal advisory support.</li>
          <li>To analyze ad performance and improve our marketing strategies.</li>
          <li>To personalize your experience on our website and with our ads.</li>
          <li>To send you promotional materials, updates, and newsletters (if you have opted in).</li>
          <li>To comply with legal obligations and protect our rights.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
          3. Sharing Your Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. However, we may share your information in the following circumstances:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 pl-4 list-disc">
          <li>With service providers who assist us in operating our website, running LinkedIn Ads, or conducting our business.</li>
          <li>With LinkedIn for advertising purposes, in accordance with LinkedIn’s privacy policy.</li>
          <li>When required by law or to protect our rights, property, or safety.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
          4. Your Rights and Choices
        </h2>
        <p>You have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600 pl-4 list-disc">
          <li><strong>Access:</strong> You can request access to the personal information we hold about you.</li>
          <li><strong>Correction:</strong> You can request that we correct or update your information.</li>
          <li><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> You can opt out of receiving promotional communications from us by following the unsubscribe link in our emails or contacting us directly.</li>
          <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> You can manage your cookie preferences through your browser settings.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm">
          To exercise these rights, please contact us at <a href={`mailto:${companyInfo.infoEmail}`} class="text-brand-navy font-semibold underline">{companyInfo.infoEmail}</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
          5. Data Security
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, alteration, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
          6. Third-Party Links
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Our website and LinkedIn Ads may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these websites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing any personal information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 border-b border-slate-100 pb-2">
          7. Changes to This Privacy Policy
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically to stay informed about how we are protecting your information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">
          8. Contact Us
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
          If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us at:
        </p>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 text-sm space-y-1">
          <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">{companyInfo.name}</p>
          <p>Email: <a href={`mailto:${companyInfo.infoEmail}`} class="text-brand-navy underline">{companyInfo.infoEmail}</a></p>
          <p>Phone: <a href={`tel:${companyInfo.phoneRaw}`} class="text-brand-navy underline">{companyInfo.phone}</a></p>
          <p>Address: {companyInfo.address.full}</p>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</MainLayout>

